{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/91c3141c9ffb53561707ed6a6ddfc977.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the snowy, dim overpass, warm lights draw people one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once unemployed abroad, and his uncle, pressured by the mother\u2019s insistence, begin running a Korean-style Pojangmacha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist takes charge of management and operations, while the uncle, skilled in cooking, satisfies the customers with ramen, fish-shaped cakes, and a variety of Korean street foods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person, single-player street food management simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unexpected events, manage customers, secure ingredients, and grow your Pojangmacha into a thriving business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is a 'Pojangmacha'?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/6a4c5743180fc6683e18fde8ab49fdf5.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/6a4c5743180fc6683e18fde8ab49fdf5.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/6a4c5743180fc6683e18fde8ab49fdf5.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 'Pojangmacha' is a small, mobile food stall commonly found in Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a cozy space where delicious food welcomes customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders and Management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/179b8275ee0f6d3ba6d7b8bff946dd5b.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/179b8275ee0f6d3ba6d7b8bff946dd5b.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/179b8275ee0f6d3ba6d7b8bff946dd5b.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you\u2019ll handle the overall operation and inventory of the Pojangmacha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders and keep the stall running smoothly so your uncle can focus on cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hygiene Management is Crucial!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/b41f5ebd526ce4d578e58646218ce0f5.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/b41f5ebd526ce4d578e58646218ce0f5.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/b41f5ebd526ce4d578e58646218ce0f5.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good management alone won\u2019t attract customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a clean and hygienic stall to keep the environment pleasant and grow your loyal customer base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected Situations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/3b1c0f48e03c00b312a82ebc6a866611.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/3b1c0f48e03c00b312a82ebc6a866611.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/3b1c0f48e03c00b312a82ebc6a866611.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drunken customers, sudden incidents\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond flexibly to various challenges and protect your unique Pojangmacha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, expand your stall, unlock more dishes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and rise to become the ultimate Pojangmacha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start running your stall for real?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785710?t=1762176583","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3785710?t=1762176583","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/d3ffad21a620f885ab6b9d7bce4a2635a8345279/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762176583","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/d3ffad21a620f885ab6b9d7bce4a2635a8345279/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762176583","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>Content Creation and Live Streaming Guide</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are free to create and stream content. However, it would be a great help to us if you could include a link to our store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you. </p></p><br><h1>Social Media</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/Social.png?t=1762176583\" /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out the latest game news on our social media channels!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/91c3141c9ffb53561707ed6a6ddfc977.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1000 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beneath the snowy, dim overpass, warm lights draw people one by one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, once unemployed abroad, and his uncle, pressured by the mother\u2019s insistence, begin running a Korean-style Pojangmacha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist takes charge of management and operations, while the uncle, skilled in cooking, satisfies the customers with ramen, fish-shaped cakes, and a variety of Korean street foods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person, single-player street food management simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unexpected events, manage customers, secure ingredients, and grow your Pojangmacha into a thriving business!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is a 'Pojangmacha'?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/6a4c5743180fc6683e18fde8ab49fdf5.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/6a4c5743180fc6683e18fde8ab49fdf5.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/6a4c5743180fc6683e18fde8ab49fdf5.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 'Pojangmacha' is a small, mobile food stall commonly found in Korea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a cozy space where delicious food welcomes customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orders and Management</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/179b8275ee0f6d3ba6d7b8bff946dd5b.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/179b8275ee0f6d3ba6d7b8bff946dd5b.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/179b8275ee0f6d3ba6d7b8bff946dd5b.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you\u2019ll handle the overall operation and inventory of the Pojangmacha.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take orders and keep the stall running smoothly so your uncle can focus on cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hygiene Management is Crucial!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/b41f5ebd526ce4d578e58646218ce0f5.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/b41f5ebd526ce4d578e58646218ce0f5.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/b41f5ebd526ce4d578e58646218ce0f5.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good management alone won\u2019t attract customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maintain a clean and hygienic stall to keep the environment pleasant and grow your loyal customer base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unexpected Situations</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/3b1c0f48e03c00b312a82ebc6a866611.poster.avif?t=1762176583\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/3b1c0f48e03c00b312a82ebc6a866611.webm?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/extras/3b1c0f48e03c00b312a82ebc6a866611.mp4?t=1762176583\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drunken customers, sudden incidents\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond flexibly to various challenges and protect your unique Pojangmacha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ultimate Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn money, expand your stall, unlock more dishes,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and rise to become the ultimate Pojangmacha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to start running your stall for real?</p>","developers":["AnomalyGuys"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3785710/01724173d72425c184a9c24e3e883e184b39b329/header.jpg?t=1762176583","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785710/1142462540/f4b1edaab49f8a07c3a50c37a8ca450534c0cfe9/1761988240/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761988812","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785710/1142462540/f4b1edaab49f8a07c3a50c37a8ca450534c0cfe9/1761988240/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761988812","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3785710/1142462540/f4b1edaab49f8a07c3a50c37a8ca450534c0cfe9/1761988240/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761988812","id":257225440,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225440/movie480.mp4?t=1761988812","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225440/movie_max.mp4?t=1761988812"},"name":"GamePlay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225440/7869151d7e367a2d490b9c82c3bd51a02c96c7e5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761988812","webm":{"480":"https://vide